('71', '74', '9', 'KAVINDI', 'SENANAYAKE', 'kavindi.senanayake@example.com', '+94 77 482 3165', '1-2 years', '1-2 years', '', '100000', 'cv_74_1790912051_6abf2633c7fe7.pdf', NULL, 'unextracted', '2026-10-02 09:07:00', '{\"ai_match_score\":9,\"ai_match_reason\":\"The candidate has a complete background in Human Resources (HR Executive\\/Assistant\\/Intern) with a degree in Human Resource Management, which is entirely unrelated to the technical requirements of a QA Engineer Intern position. They lack any coding, software testing, QA methodologies, or Jira experience required for this role.\",\"is_job_mismatch\":true,\"mismatch_reason\":\"The candidate\'s entire education and professional career background are in Human Resources Management, whereas the target position is a technical QA Engineer Intern role requiring programming, software testing, and Jira.\",\"ai_score_breakdown\":{\"skills_match_score\":0,\"experience_match_score\":0,\"qualification_match_score\":20,\"job_description_match_score\":0,\"salary_match_score\":100},\"first_name\":\"Kavindi\",\"last_name\":\"Senanayake\",\"email\":\"kavindi.senanayake@example.com\",\"contact_number\":\"+94 77 482 3165\",\"qualification\":\"Bachelor of Business Management (Hons) in Human Resource Management\",\"overall_experience\":\"3-4 years\",\"relevant_experience\":\"0 years\",\"salary_expectation\":\"Not specified\",\"profile_summary\":\"Proactive and detail-oriented HR Executive with over 3 years of experience in recruitment, onboarding, employee records, attendance and leave administration, HR documentation, performance support, employee engagement, and HR reporting.\",\"experience_summary\":\"HR Executive at Apex Business Solutions (Pvt) Ltd (Apr 2024 - Present), HR Assistant at Ceylon Corporate Services (Pvt) Ltd (Jan 2023 - Mar 2024), and HR Intern at Lanka Consumer Products PLC (Jul 2022 - Dec 2022).\",\"recruiter_insights\":[\"Complete domain mismatch: candidate is an HR professional applying for a technical QA Engineer Intern position.\",\"No evidence of software testing, coding languages, QA methodologies, or Jira usage.\"],\"skills_analysis\":[{\"skill\":\"Coding\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":false},{\"skill\":\"QA\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":false},{\"skill\":\"Jira\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":false},{\"skill\":\"Microsoft Excel\",\"category\":\"Additional Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Advanced\",\"verified\":true},{\"skill\":\"Communication\",\"category\":\"Additional Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Advanced\",\"verified\":true}],\"fully_demonstrated_skills\":[\"Microsoft Excel\"],\"partially_demonstrated_skills\":[],\"requirements_without_evidence\":[\"Coding\",\"QA\",\"Jira\"],\"additional_skills\":[\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Microsoft Word\",\"Microsoft PowerPoint\",\"Microsoft Outlook\",\"Microsoft Teams\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"HRIS\",\"Applicant Tracking Systems\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Canva\"],\"qualifications_found\":[\"Bachelor of Business Management (Hons) in Human Resource Management\",\"Professional Qualification in Human Resource Management\"],\"certifications_found\":[\"Advanced Microsoft Excel for HR Professionals - 2025\",\"Certificate in Labour Law and Employee Relations - 2024\",\"Interviewing and Candidate Selection Workshop - 2024\",\"HR Analytics Fundamentals - 2023\",\"Microsoft 365 Productivity Training - 2023\"],\"extracted_full_text\":\"KAVINDI SENANAYAKE\\nHR Executive | Recruitment | HR Administration | Employee Relations\\nColombo, Sri Lanka | +94 77 482 3165 | kavindi.senanayake@example.com | linkedin.com\\/in\\/kavindisenanayake\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\\nProactive and detail-oriented HR Executive with over 3 years of experience in recruitment, onboarding, employee records, attendance and leave administration, HR documentation, performance support, employee engagement, and HR reporting. Experienced in coordinating full-cycle recruitment activities, maintaining confidential employee data, preparing HR letters and reports, and supporting managers with day-to-day people operations. Proficient in Microsoft Excel, Microsoft 365, HRIS platforms, and candidate tracking systems. Strong communication, organization, confidentiality, and interpersonal skills with a practical understanding of Sri Lankan HR practices.\\n\\nCORE HR SKILLS\\nRecruitment & Selection: Job posting, CV screening, candidate shortlisting, interview scheduling, offer coordination\\nHR Administration: Employee files, HR letters, contracts, confirmation documentation, record maintenance\\nEmployee Lifecycle: Onboarding, orientation, probation tracking, transfers, resignations, exit clearance\\nAttendance & Leave: Attendance monitoring, leave records, monthly summaries, employee follow-up\\nPerformance & Training: Appraisal coordination, training schedules, development records, evaluation support\\nEmployee Relations: Employee queries, engagement activities, communication, issue escalation\\nHR Systems & Tools: HRIS, applicant tracking systems, Microsoft Excel, Word, PowerPoint, Microsoft 365\\nReporting: Headcount reports, recruitment status reports, attendance reports, HR dashboards\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\\nHR Executive\\nApex Business Solutions (Pvt) Ltd - Colombo, Sri Lanka | Apr 2024 - Present\\n- Coordinate end-to-end recruitment activities for executive, administrative, technical, and support roles.\\n- Publish job vacancies, screen CVs, prepare candidate shortlists, schedule interviews, and communicate with applicants.\\n- Prepare appointment letters, confirmation letters, service letters, transfer letters, and other employee documentation.\\n- Maintain employee personal files, HRIS records, emergency contact details, and confidential personnel information.\\n- Manage attendance and leave records and prepare monthly summaries for payroll and management review.\\n- Coordinate new employee onboarding, orientation sessions, policy briefings, and probation follow-up activities.\\n- Support performance appraisal cycles by preparing schedules, forms, reminders, and completion reports.\\n- Assist with employee engagement activities, staff events, training programs, and internal communication initiatives.\\n- Prepare monthly HR reports covering headcount, recruitment status, staff turnover, attendance, leave, and vacancies.\\n- Support resignation, clearance, exit interview, and final documentation processes.\\n- Respond to routine employee HR queries and escalate sensitive matters to the HR Manager when required.\\n- Maintain high standards of confidentiality when handling employee and management information.\\n\\nHR Assistant\\nCeylon Corporate Services (Pvt) Ltd - Colombo, Sri Lanka | Jan 2023 - Mar 2024\\n- Assisted with recruitment advertisements, CV screening, interview coordination, and candidate database updates.\\n- Prepared onboarding checklists, employee files, ID requests, and orientation documents for new employees.\\n- Updated attendance, leave, probation, and employee master records using the company HR system.\\n- Supported payroll preparation by checking attendance, no-pay leave, overtime, and employee changes.\\n- Maintained training attendance records and assisted with staff development programs.\\n- Helped organize employee engagement events, staff welfare activities, and internal meetings.\\n- Prepared basic HR reports using Microsoft Excel, including leave summaries, headcount data, and recruitment trackers.\\n- Filed HR documents systematically and assisted during internal and external HR audits.\\n\\nHR Intern\\nLanka Consumer Products PLC - Wattala, Sri Lanka | Jul 2022 - Dec 2022\\n- Supported the HR team with filing, data entry, recruitment coordination, and employee record updates.\\n- Assisted with interview scheduling and candidate communication.\\n- Prepared employee documentation and maintained training and attendance records.\\n- Participated in induction sessions and staff engagement activities.\\n\\nEDUCATION\\nBachelor of Business Management (Hons) in Human Resource Management\\nMetropolitan University of Sri Lanka | 2018 - 2022\\nRelevant modules: Human Resource Management, Recruitment and Selection, Employee Relations, Performance Management, Training and Development, Organizational Behaviour, Business Law, Strategic Management, and Research Methods.\\n\\nProfessional Qualification in Human Resource Management\\nInstitute of Personnel Management - Sri Lanka | 2022\\n\\nCERTIFICATIONS & TRAINING\\n- Advanced Microsoft Excel for HR Professionals - 2025\\n- Certificate in Labour Law and Employee Relations - 2024\\n- Interviewing and Candidate Selection Workshop - 2024\\n- HR Analytics Fundamentals - 2023\\n- Microsoft 365 Productivity Training - 2023\\n\\nKEY ACHIEVEMENTS\\n- Improved recruitment tracking by introducing a structured candidate status tracker used by the HR team.\\n- Supported the successful onboarding of more than 60 employees across multiple departments.\\n- Helped reduce delays in monthly attendance reporting by standardizing the HR attendance review process.\\n- Coordinated employee engagement activities with participation from staff across multiple business units.\\n\\nHR SYSTEMS & SOFTWARE\\nMicrosoft Excel | Microsoft Word | Microsoft PowerPoint | Microsoft Outlook | Microsoft Teams | Microsoft 365 | HRIS | Applicant Tracking Systems | Google Workspace | Canva\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL SKILLS\\nCommunication | Interpersonal Skills | Confidentiality | Organization | Time Management | Attention to Detail | Teamwork | Problem Solving | Adaptability | Professionalism | Employee Coordination\\n\\nLANGUAGES\\nSinhala: Native English: Professional Working Proficiency Tamil: Basic Proficiency\\n\\nPERSONAL DETAILS\\nFull Name: Kavindi Senanayake\\nCurrent Location: Colombo, Sri Lanka\\nAvailability: One month notice\\n\\nREFERENCES\\nMs. Tharushi Perera\\nHR Manager, Apex Business Solutions (Pvt) Ltd\\nEmail: tharushi.perera@example.com | Phone: +94 77 612 4481\\n\\nMr. Ruwan Jayawardena\\nSenior Lecturer - Human Resource Management\\nEmail: ruwan.jayawardena@example.com | Phone: +94 71 804 2259\\n\\nFictional CV created for recruitment-system and ATS testing purposes only.\"}', '0', 'shortlisted', '', '{\"ai_match_score\":9,\"ai_match_reason\":\"The candidate has a complete background in Human Resources (HR Executive\\/Assistant\\/Intern) with a degree in Human Resource Management, which is entirely unrelated to the technical requirements of a QA Engineer Intern position. They lack any coding, software testing, QA methodologies, or Jira experience required for this role.\",\"ai_score_breakdown\":{\"skills_match_score\":0,\"experience_match_score\":0,\"qualification_match_score\":20,\"job_description_match_score\":0,\"salary_match_score\":100},\"is_job_mismatch\":true,\"mismatch_reason\":\"The candidate\'s entire education and professional career background are in Human Resources Management, whereas the target position is a technical QA Engineer Intern role requiring programming, software testing, and Jira.\",\"skills_analysis\":[{\"skill\":\"Coding\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":false},{\"skill\":\"QA\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":false},{\"skill\":\"Jira\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":false},{\"skill\":\"Microsoft Excel\",\"category\":\"Additional Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Advanced\",\"verified\":true},{\"skill\":\"Communication\",\"category\":\"Additional Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Advanced\",\"verified\":true}],\"fully_demonstrated_skills\":[\"Microsoft Excel\"],\"partially_demonstrated_skills\":[],\"requirements_without_evidence\":[\"Coding\",\"QA\",\"Jira\"],\"additional_skills\":[\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Microsoft Word\",\"Microsoft PowerPoint\",\"Microsoft Outlook\",\"Microsoft Teams\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"HRIS\",\"Applicant Tracking Systems\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Canva\"],\"qualifications_found\":[\"Bachelor of Business Management (Hons) in Human Resource Management\",\"Professional Qualification in Human Resource Management\"],\"certifications_found\":[\"Advanced Microsoft Excel for HR Professionals - 2025\",\"Certificate in Labour Law and Employee Relations - 2024\",\"Interviewing and Candidate Selection Workshop - 2024\",\"HR Analytics Fundamentals - 2023\",\"Microsoft 365 Productivity Training - 2023\"],\"experience_summary\":\"HR Executive at Apex Business Solutions (Pvt) Ltd (Apr 2024 - Present), HR Assistant at Ceylon Corporate Services (Pvt) Ltd (Jan 2023 - Mar 2024), and HR Intern at Lanka Consumer Products PLC (Jul 2022 - Dec 2022).\",\"recruiter_insights\":[\"Complete domain mismatch: candidate is an HR professional applying for a technical QA Engineer Intern position.\",\"No evidence of software testing, coding languages, QA methodologies, or Jira usage.\"]}', NULL, 'On-site', '2026-10-14', '10:00', 'George Steuart Optimize — BoardRoom', 'No. 439, Galle Road, Colombo 03, Sri Lanka.', '2026-10-02 09:04:11', '0', '0', NULL, 'pending'),
('72', '74', '16', 'Nethmi', 'Jayasinghe', 'nethmi.jayasinghe@example.com', '+94 75 903 1184', '3-4 years', '3-4 years', '', '100000', 'cv_74_1790912082_6abf2652c6b98.pdf', NULL, 'unextracted', '2026-10-02 09:05:37', '{\"ai_match_score\":16,\"ai_match_reason\":\"Nethmi Jayasinghe is an Assistant Accountant with a background in financial accounting, accounts payable, accounts receivable, and financial reporting. She has no technical background, coding skills, QA experience, or familiarity with Jira, making her entirely unsuited for the QA Engineer Intern role.\",\"is_job_mismatch\":true,\"mismatch_reason\":\"The candidate\'s professional background, education, and career experience are strictly within Accounting and Finance, whereas the target position is for a QA Engineer Intern requiring software testing, coding, and quality assurance skills.\",\"ai_score_breakdown\":{\"skills_match_score\":0,\"experience_match_score\":10,\"qualification_match_score\":40,\"job_description_match_score\":0,\"salary_match_score\":90},\"first_name\":\"Nethmi\",\"last_name\":\"Jayasinghe\",\"email\":\"nethmi.jayasinghe@example.com\",\"contact_number\":\"+94 75 903 1184\",\"qualification\":\"BSc in Accounting and Finance\",\"overall_experience\":\"3-4 years\",\"relevant_experience\":\"0 years\",\"salary_expectation\":\"Not specified\",\"profile_summary\":\"Organized and analytical Assistant Accountant with 3+ years of experience in accounts payable, accounts receivable, bank reconciliations, journal entries, expense analysis, month-end support, and financial reporting.\",\"experience_summary\":\"Assistant Accountant at HillCapital Holdings (Pvt) Ltd (Mar 2024 - Present) and Accounts Assistant at Lanka Distribution Services (Jan 2022 - Feb 2024), focusing on financial processing, reconciliations, accounts payable\\/receivable, and auditing support.\",\"recruiter_insights\":[\"Complete domain mismatch: The candidate is an accountant applying for a technical QA engineering role.\",\"Lacks all mandatory technical requirements including coding, QA methodologies, and Jira.\"],\"skills_analysis\":[{\"skill\":\"Microsoft Excel\",\"category\":\"Additional Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Advanced\",\"verified\":true},{\"skill\":\"SAP Business One\",\"category\":\"Additional Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Intermediate\",\"verified\":true},{\"skill\":\"QuickBooks\",\"category\":\"Additional Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Intermediate\",\"verified\":true}],\"fully_demonstrated_skills\":[\"Microsoft Excel\",\"SAP Business One\",\"QuickBooks\"],\"partially_demonstrated_skills\":[],\"requirements_without_evidence\":[\"Coding\",\"QA\",\"Jira\",\"Test Planning\",\"Test Automation\"],\"additional_skills\":[\"Microsoft Excel\",\"SAP Business One\",\"QuickBooks\",\"Bank Reconciliation\",\"Accounts Payable\",\"Accounts Receivable\"],\"qualifications_found\":[\"BSc in Accounting and Finance\"],\"certifications_found\":[\"Advanced Microsoft Excel for Finance\",\"QuickBooks Online Fundamentals\",\"Certificate in Business Accounting\"],\"extracted_full_text\":\"Nethmi Jayasinghe\\nAssistant Accountant | Financial Reporting | Accounts Payable and Receivable\\nKandy, Sri Lanka | +94 75 903 1184 | nethmi.jayasinghe@example.com | linkedin.com\\/in\\/nethmijayasinghe\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\\nOrganized and analytical Assistant Accountant with 3+ years of experience in accounts payable, accounts receivable, bank reconciliations, journal entries, expense analysis, month-end support, and financial reporting. Proficient in Microsoft Excel, QuickBooks, ERP-based transaction processing, and maintaining accurate financial records. Known for careful documentation, deadline management, and effective coordination with suppliers and internal departments.\\n\\nCORE SKILLS\\nAccounting: Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable, General Ledger, Journal Entries, Bank Reconciliation\\nFinancial Operations: Invoice Processing, Petty Cash, Expense Analysis, Month-End Closing Support\\nReporting: Management Reports, Ageing Reports, Variance Analysis, Audit Schedules\\nSoftware: Microsoft Excel, QuickBooks, SAP Business One, Microsoft Word, PowerPoint\\nExcel: PivotTables, VLOOKUP\\/XLOOKUP, SUMIFS, Charts, Data Validation\\nProfessional: Accuracy, Confidentiality, Time Management, Vendor Communication, Documentation\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\\nAssistant Accountant\\nHillCapital Holdings (Pvt) Ltd - Kandy, Sri Lanka | Mar 2024 - Present\\n- Process supplier invoices, customer receipts, journal entries, and payment documentation.\\n- Prepare monthly bank reconciliations and investigate unmatched transactions.\\n- Maintain accounts payable and receivable schedules and follow up outstanding balances.\\n- Support month-end closing through accruals, prepayment schedules, and ledger reviews.\\n- Prepare expense summaries and financial schedules for management and external audit purposes.\\n- Use Excel and SAP Business One for transaction analysis and financial reporting.\\n\\nAccounts Assistant\\nLanka Distribution Services - Kandy, Sri Lanka | Jan 2022 - Feb 2024\\n- Recorded daily receipts, supplier payments, expenses, and petty-cash transactions.\\n- Assisted with invoice verification and purchase-order matching.\\n- Prepared customer ageing reports and supported credit-control follow-ups.\\n- Maintained finance files and provided documents requested during audits.\\n- Prepared Excel summaries for monthly operational and finance reviews.\\n\\nEDUCATION\\nBSc in Accounting and Finance\\nCentral Business University, Sri Lanka | 2018 - 2021\\nRelevant modules: Financial Accounting, Management Accounting, Taxation, Auditing, Corporate Finance, Business Law.\\n\\nCA Sri Lanka - Business Level\\nInstitute of Chartered Accountants of Sri Lanka | Ongoing\\nCompleted selected foundation and business-level subjects; continuing professional accounting studies.\\n\\nSELECTED PROJECTS\\nSupplier Reconciliation Improvement\\nTechnologies: Microsoft Excel, SAP Business One\\n- Created a structured reconciliation tracker for supplier statements, invoices, credit notes, and payments.\\n- Improved visibility of unresolved items and simplified month-end follow-up.\\n\\nMonthly Expense Dashboard\\nTechnologies: Microsoft Excel\\n- Built an Excel dashboard summarizing department expenses against monthly budgets.\\n- Used PivotTables and formulas to highlight major variances for management review.\\n\\nCERTIFICATIONS\\n- Advanced Microsoft Excel for Finance - 2025\\n- QuickBooks Online Fundamentals - 2024\\n- Certificate in Business Accounting - 2022\\n\\nACHIEVEMENTS\\n- Recognized for maintaining accurate finance records during an annual external audit.\\n- Helped streamline supplier reconciliation tracking and month-end document preparation.\\n\\nLANGUAGES\\nSinhala - Native | English - Professional\\n\\nREFERENCES\\nChathura Bandara - Finance Manager, HillCapital Holdings - chathura.bandara@example.com - +94 77 556 7788\\nDilini Perera - Senior Lecturer, Central Business University - dilini.perera@example.com - +94 71 667 9900\\n\\nFictional sample CV created for software testing purposes.\"}', '0', 'shortlisted', '', '{\"ai_match_score\":16,\"ai_match_reason\":\"Nethmi Jayasinghe is an Assistant Accountant with a background in financial accounting, accounts payable, accounts receivable, and financial reporting. She has no technical background, coding skills, QA experience, or familiarity with Jira, making her entirely unsuited for the QA Engineer Intern role.\",\"ai_score_breakdown\":{\"skills_match_score\":0,\"experience_match_score\":10,\"qualification_match_score\":40,\"job_description_match_score\":0,\"salary_match_score\":90},\"is_job_mismatch\":true,\"mismatch_reason\":\"The candidate\'s professional background, education, and career experience are strictly within Accounting and Finance, whereas the target position is for a QA Engineer Intern requiring software testing, coding, and quality assurance skills.\",\"skills_analysis\":