endors, Suppliers, POs, and PRs.\n- Experience with Asset Management Systems, SysAid helpdesk software, SAP 760, and Microsoft 365.\n- Handling Onsite Projects to optimize network performances and support.\n\nProjects:\nProject: Network Refinement – Unichela Koggala\nDuration: October 2024 - May 2025\n- Participated in the Network Refinement project covering Active, Passive, and Wi-Fi infrastructure.\n- Acquired hands-on exposure to Active Network refinement processes executed by the NOC team.\n- Assisted in Passive and Wi-Fi network refinement activities.\n- Supported verification of the Bill of Materials to ensure project accuracy.\n- Participated in reviewing and evaluating vendor quotations.\n- Coordinated with vendors and internal teams to support smooth project implementation.\n- Provided IT support for network connectivity and end-user issues during the refinement period.\n\nEducation:\n- BEng (Hons) Computer Networking, University of London Metropolitan, Graduated 2023\n- HND in Computer Network Technology, ICBT Colombo Campus, 2021-2022\n- Advanced Certification of Network Administration, NIBM Colombo Campus\n\nSkills:\n- Experience with Fortigate Firewall: SD-WAN, IPsec VPN, SSL VPN, ADVPN\n- Windows Server Administration 2019\n- Office 365\n- VPN\n- Wireless Network\n- TeamViewer, AnyDesk, Remote Desktop, Zoom\n- OS and application setup, system imaging\n- Basic TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP, LAN/WAN troubleshooting\n\nReferees:\n- Mr. Hirannye Senanayake, IT Business Lead, IT Business Services, MAS Holdings (Pvt) Ltd, Contact: +94772963170\n- Mr. Gayath Samaraweera, Manager IT Escalation, Contact: +94773148117\n- Mr. Tharusha Nonis, Senior Associate Plant Digital Evangelist, Contact: +94770507029', 'extracted', '2026-10-14 03:20:35', '{\"ai_match_score\":93,\"ai_match_reason\":\"The candidate, Lahiru Alagiyawanna, is an exceptionally strong fit for the Trainee IT Associate position, exceeding the minimum educational and experience requirements with a BEng (Hons) in 