ers, wireless access points\nSystems Administration: Active Directory, Microsoft 365\nNetwork Security: FortiGate firewall administration and basic firewall updates\nTechnical Support: Network troubleshooting, end-user support, incident resolution\nInfrastructure Monitoring: Network performance monitoring and operational support\nDocumentation: Configuration documentation and technical incident records\n\nEducation & Professional Development:\nBachelor of Information Technology - SLIIT | Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (2023 - Present)\nG.C.E. Advanced Level - Technology Stream - Mahinda Rajapaksha College\n\nCourses:\n- Cisco Networking Academy - Introduction to IoT\n- Fortinet Training Institute - FortiGate 7.6 Operator\n\nProfessional Strengths:\n- Hands-on exposure to IT infrastructure and enterprise networking environments.\n- Experience supporting both local operations and overseas company sites.\n- Practical troubleshooting and incident-resolution experience.\n- Ability to document technical configurations and incidents clearly.', 'extracted', '2026-10-14 03:21:52', '{\"ai_match_score\":86,\"ai_match_reason\":\"Lakshitha Walallawita is a strong fit for the Trainee IT Associate position, bringing practical experience in IT infrastructure, networking, and end-user support as an Assistant Administrator and Intern. His background at SLIIT pursuing a BSc in IT directly supports the educational requirements, and his salary expectation aligns well with the company budget.\",\"is_job_mismatch\":false,\"mismatch_reason\":\"\",\"ai_score_breakdown\":{\"skills_match_score\":85,\"experience_match_score\":80,\"qualification_match_score\":90,\"job_description_match_score\":75,\"salary_match_score\":100},\"first_name\":\"Lakshitha\",\"last_name\":\"Walallawita\",\"email\":\"lakshithawalallawita01@gmail.com\",\"contact_number\":\"+94 76 5999 102\",\"qualification\":\"Bachelor of Information Technology (Undergraduate)\",\"overall_experience\":\"1-2 years\",\"rel