('170', '85', '77', 'Avishka', 'Pasindu Vijayanga', 'avishkapvijayanga@gmail.com', '+94 77 420 2926', '0 years', '0 years', 'Higher National Diploma in Information Technology (HNDIT)', '30000', 'cv_85_1791952849_6acf07d126eea.pdf', 'Avishka Pasindu Vijayanga | +94 77 420 2926 | linkedin.com/in/avishka-pasindu | avishkapvijayanga@gmail.com | https://github.com/avishkapvijayanga | Nuwara Eliya, Sri Lanka\n\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nMotivated HNDIT graduate with a strong foundation in IT Support, Networking, and System Administration. Skilled in hardware and software troubleshooting, Windows, Linux, TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP, and basic network troubleshooting. Familiar with operating systems, IT security fundamentals, and technical support. Strong problem solving and analytical skills with a passion for resolving technical issues and maintaining reliable IT systems. Eager to learn, contribute to a professional IT team, and build a career in IT Support, Networking, Infrastructure, or System Administration.\n\nEDUCATION\nHigher National Diploma in Information Technology (HNDIT)\nSri Lanka Institute of Advanced Technological Education, Nawalapitiya\n2024 – Present\n\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\n• IT Support: Hardware & Software Troubleshooting, Technical Support\n• Networking: TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP, Network Fundamentals\n• Systems: Windows, Linux Fundamentals, OS Support\n• Security: Cybersecurity Fundamentals\n• Tools: Microsoft Office, Git & GitHub\n• Database: MySQL, DBMS\n• Web: PHP, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Laravel, React\n• Soft Skills: Problem Solving, Analytical Thinking, Team Collaboration\n\nACADEMIC PROJECTS\nNextStep - Based Internship Placement System | PHP (Laravel), MySQL, Bootstrap\n- Developed a role based internship placement platform for Students, Employers, and Admin.\n- Implemented internship posting, online application, CV upload, and application tracking features.\n- Built using Laravel MVC with MySQL and a responsive Bootstrap interface.\n\nCinetalk - Entertainment Platfor