ied\":true},{\"skill\":\"Windows\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":true},{\"skill\":\"MS Office\",\"category\":\"Relevant Skills\",\"experience_level\":\"Beginner\",\"verified\":true}],\"fully_demonstrated_skills\":[\"IT Support\",\"Hardware Troubleshooting\",\"Windows\",\"MS Office\"],\"partially_demonstrated_skills\":[\"LAN\\/WAN\"],\"requirements_without_evidence\":[\"Valid Motorbike license\"],\"additional_skills\":[\"Networking Fundamentals\"],\"qualifications_found\":[],\"certifications_found\":[],\"experience_summary\":\"Fresh graduate \\/ entry-level profile with 0-1 years of general exposure to IT systems and support tasks.\",\"recruiter_insights\":[\"Meets the entry-level experience criteria and salary expectations for the Trainee IT Associate role.\",\"Holds a Bachelors Degree which exceeds the minimum diploma requirement.\"]}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-14 11:16:00', '0', '0', NULL, 'pending'),
('186', '85', '90', 'Nethmini', 'Rajamanthri', 'nethminirajamanthri@gmail.com', '0718787015', '1-2 years', '1-2 years', 'BIT(Hons) in Networking and Mobile Computing', '30000', 'cv_85_1791972744_6acf55881cabf.pdf', 'Nethmini Niresha Rajamanthri\nKaduwela, Sri Lanka\nPhone: 0718787015 / 0782398873\nEmail: nethminirajamanthri@gmail.com\n\nOBJECTIVE\nA dedicated and enthusiastic graduate with strong analytical and technical skills. Passionate about learning new technologies and applying knowledge to solve real-world problems. I am a responsible team player with good communication skills, seeking an opportunity to grow professionally while contributing effectively to a dynamic organization.\n\nEXPERIENCE\nAbans Group PLC (December 2024 - August 2026)\nJunior Network Administrator | Colombo 03, Sri Lanka\nDelivered enterprise IT deployment and Network support services across Abans Client sites, including HNB Head Office and The Ministry Of Education.\n\nCLIENT ASSIGNMENTS\nHNB Head Office – IT Deployment Support (May 2025 - July 2025)\nClient-site assignment through Abans Group PLC | Colombo 10, Sri Lanka\n- Installed operating systems and approved software across 500 desktop computers for the HNB Head Office deployment.\n- Installed and configured CrowdStrike Endpoint Security to support endpoint protection requirements.\n- Configured required Control Panel settings, created administrator accounts, and verified each computer before handover.\n\nMinistry of Education – Network and Smart Classroom Support (Jan 2025 - June 2026)\nClient-site assignment through Abans Group PLC | Pelawatta, Sri Lanka\n- Provided on-site technical service for the deployment and operation of Huawei switches, access points, SmartBoards, and video-conferencing equipment.\n- Supported device integration, network monitoring, troubleshooting, and routine maintenance in line with project IT standards.\n- Used Huawei iMaster NCE Campus for performance monitoring and issue identification to support service continuity.\n\nEDUCATION\nHorizon Campus (2021-2025)\nBIT(Hons) in Networking and Mobile Computing | Malabe, Sri Lanka\n\nJanadhipathi Balika Vidyalaya (2017-2019)\nAdvanced Level | Nawala, Sri Lanka\n\nPROJECTS\nBill Payment System (2022)\nTools: Java Language, MySQL\nDeveloped a reliable bill payment system using Java and MySQL that automates payment management, improves accuracy, and ensures secure record handling.\n\nRemote Desktop Viewer Application (2023)\nTools: Java, Socket Programming\nDeveloped a Remote Desktop Viewer application using Java and socket programming to secure real-time access, monitoring, and control of remote systems.\n\nIoT Based Public Transport Solution with Digital Ticketing, Tracking and Real-Time Passenger Monitoring (2025)\nTools: Java, Python, Android Studio, IoT Devices (Raspberry Pi, Camera Modules etc.)\nDesigned an IoT-based public transport solution that enables digital ticketing, vehicle tracking, and real-time passenger monitoring for improved efficiency, transparency, and user convenience.\n\nSKILLS\nNetworking: Networking Concepts, CISCO Configurations, Huawei Configurations\nProgramming Languages: HTML, PHP, Java, C, Python\nOther Skills: Critical Thinking, Leadership, Collaboration, Time Management, Effective Communication\n\nCERTIFICATIONS\n- CCNA Certified (December 2024, Cisco Networking Academy)\n- Introduction to Network (March 2024)\n- Switching, Routing and Wireless Essentials (May 2024)\n- Enterprise Networking, Security, and Automation (June 2024)\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\nLanguages: Sinhala (Proficiency level), English (Proficiency level)\nInterests: Reading, Networking, Sports, Gaming, Coding\n\nREFERENCES\n1. Mr. Buddhika Gihan Ekanayake\nSolution Architect (Enterprise Solution)\nAbans PLC\nEmail: buddhikag@abansgroup.com\nPhone: 0718190318\n\n2. Mr. Daminda Herath\nSenior Lecturer\nHorizon Campus\nEmail: damindaherath@horizoncampus.edu.lk\nPhone: 0777296275', 'extracted', '2026-10-14 10:12:32', '{\"ai_m