('189', '85', '21', 'Nethmi', 'Jayasinghe', 'nethmi.jayasinghe@example.com', '+94 75 903 1184', '3-4 years', '0 years', 'Bachelors Degree', '30000', 'cv_85_1791977147_6acf66bbe0b8d.pdf', NULL, 'unextracted', NULL, '{\"ai_match_score\":21}', '0', 'pending', '', '{\"ai_match_score\":21,\"ai_match_reason\":\"The candidate has a background exclusively in accounting, finance, and financial reporting (Assistant Accountant) with a BSc in Accounting and Finance, which is fundamentally misaligned with the technical requirements of the Trainee IT Associate position. Although salary expectations and experience levels are compatible, the CV completely lacks IT-related core skills, network infrastructure knowledge, hardware\\/software troubleshooting experience, and the required IT diploma.\",\"unextracted_reason\":\"Candidate AI match score (21%) is below the minimum threshold (50%).\",\"is_unextracted\":true,\"is_job_mismatch\":true,\"mismatch_reason\":\"The candidate\'s education and entire professional career are in Accounting and Finance, whereas the position is for a Trainee IT Associate requiring IT infrastructure, hardware\\/software troubleshooting, and networking skills.\",\"ai_score_breakdown\":{\"skills_match_score\":10,\"experience_match_score\":10,\"qualification_match_score\":40,\"job_description_match_score\":10,\"salary_match_score\":100}}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-14 16:55:55', '0', '0', NULL, 'pending'),
('190', '86', '87', 'Nadumi', 'Perera', 'nadumi672@gmail.com', '+94 77 123 4567', '0-1 years', '0-1 years', 'BSc (Hons) in Software Engineering', '20000', 'cv_86_1792041591_6ad0627754db0.pdf', 'NADUMI PERERA\nSoftware Engineering Graduate | Junior Full-Stack Developer\nnadumi672@gmail.com\n+94 77 123 4567\nColombo, Sri Lanka\nlinkedin.com/in/nadumi-perera\ngithub.com/nadumi-perera\nSample CV created for system testing purposes\n\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nMotivated Software Engineering graduate with hands-on experience in web application development, database design, API integration, testing, and collaborative software projects. Comfortable working with React, JavaScript, PHP, MySQL, Git, and modern development workflows. Strong problem-solving, communication, and documentation skills, with a keen interest in building secure and user-friendly systems.\n\nCORE SKILLS\nFrontend: React.js, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Responsive UI\nBackend: PHP, REST APIs, Node.js fundamentals\nDatabase: MySQL, SQL queries, relational database design\nTools & Practices: Git, GitHub, VS Code, Postman, Agile/Scrum, QA testing, documentation\nOther: Microsoft Office, Figma basics, troubleshooting\nSoft Skills: Teamwork, communication, time management, analytical thinking\nLanguages: English, Sinhala\nAvailability: Open to junior software engineering / IT roles\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE\nJunior Software Developer Intern | Nova Digital Solutions (Sample Company) | Jan 2026 - Jun 2026\n- Supported the development and maintenance of responsive web applications using React, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS.\n- Integrated frontend forms with backend APIs and validated data before database submission.\n- Created and tested MySQL queries for application modules, reports, and basic data validation.\n- Used Git and GitHub for version control, branch-based development, code reviews, and issue tracking.\n- Assisted with functional testing, bug fixing, documentation, and deployment checks.\n\nIT Support Trainee | Bluewave