('196', '87', '89', 'Lahiru', 'Alagiyawanna', 'laharulakmal95731@gmail.com', '0717612542', '3-4 years', '3-4 years', 'HND in Computer network Technology', '30000', 'cv_87_1792053826_6ad0924268d7d.pdf', 'Lahiru alagiyawanna\nIT support specialist\nD 240/1 Tholangamuwa | lahirulakmal95731@gmail.com | 0717612542 | linkedin.com/in/lahiru-alagiyawanna\n\nProfessional summary\nDetail-oriented and highly skilled IT Specialist with 2 years and 5 months of experience in providing technical support, managing systems, and implementing IT solutions. Proven ability to troubleshoot complex issues, optimize IT infrastructure, and support end-users with professionalism and efficiency. Possesses strong knowledge of Windows environments, networking, cloud platforms, and cybersecurity best practices.\n\nWork Experience\nIt support associate\nMAS holdings (Pvt. ltd) Methliya | Oct 2023 - Jully 2024\n• Troubleshooting desktops, laptops, printers, and any IT resource.\n• Providing technical support on-site or via remote-access systems.\n• Offering solutions that meet the needs of the users.\n• Network infrastructure monitoring and maintenance using SipMon, Fortigate, and ZoneDirect web interfaces.\n• Managing guest logins to the network.\n• Upgrading, Installing, and configuring new hardware and software solutions.\n• Managing IT related Finance and Business Operations that needs to the site IT infrastructure including handling Vendors, Suppliers, POs, and PRs.\n• Experience with Asset Management Systems, SysAid helpdesk software, SAP 760, and Microsoft 365.\n• Creating Power Apps with automated flows.\n• Proper end-user support and documentation as per company SOPs and SLAs.\n• Handling Onsite Projects to optimize network performances and support.\n\nIt support specialist\nMAS holdings (Pvt. ltd) Intimates Thurulie | Oct 2024 - present\n• Troubleshooting desktops, laptops, printers, and any IT resource.\n• Upgrading, Installing, and configuring new hardware and software solutions.\n• Experience with Asset Management Systems, SysAid helpdesk software, SAP 760, and Microsoft 365.\n• Handling Onsite Projects to optimize network performances and support.\n\nProjects\nProject: Network Refinement – Unichela Koggala\nDuration: October 2024 – May 2025\n• Participated in the Network Refinement project covering Active, Passive, and Wi-Fi infrastructure.\n• Acquired hands-on exposure to Active Network refinement processes executed by the NOC team.\n• Assisted in Passive and Wi-Fi network refinement activities.\n• Supported verification of the Bill of Materials to ensure project accuracy.\n• Participated in reviewing and evaluating vendor quotations.\n• Coordinated with vendors and internal teams to support smooth project implementation.\n• Provided IT support for network connectivity and end-user issues during the refinement period.\n\nEducation\nBEng(Hons) in Computer networking\nUniversity of London metropolitan | Graduated - 2023\nHND in Computer network Technology\nICBT Colombo Campus | 2021 - 2022\nAdvanced Certification of Network Administration\nNIBM Colombo Campus | 2022\n\nSkills\n• Experience with Fortigate Firewall: SD-WAN, IPsec VPN, SSL VPN, ADVPN\n• Windows server Administration 2019\n• Office 365\n• VPN\n• Wireless Network\n• TeamViewer, AnyDesk, Remote Desktop, Zoom\n• OS and application setup, system imaging\n• Basic TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP, LAN/WAN troubleshooting\n\nReferences\nMr. Hirannye Senanayake\nIT Business Lead – IT Business Services - MC\nMAS Holdings (Pvt) ltd\nContact: +94772963170\n\nMr. Gayath Samaraweera\nManager – IT Escalation - MC\nContact: +94773148117\n\nMr. Tharusha Nonis\nSenior Associate - Plant Digital Evangelist\nContact: +94770507029', 'extracted', '2026-10-15 08:43:57', '{\"ai_match_score\":89,\"ai_match_reason\":\"The candidate is a strong fit for the IT Associate position, possessing over 2 years of relevant hands-on IT support and networking experience at MAS Holdings. Their qualifications in computer networking alig