e George Steuart Careers Portal.<br>\r\n                  Please do not reply directly to this email.\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p style=\'margin:8px 0 0;font-size:10px;color:#cbd5e1;\'>\r\n                  &copy; 2026 George Steuart &amp; Company Ltd. All rights reserved.\r\n                </p>\r\n              </td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n\r\n          </table>\r\n        </td></tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </body>\r\n    </html>\r\n    ', 'sent', '1', NULL, '2026-06-22 14:24:11', '2026-06-22 14:24:21'),
