lection process.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"details-box\">\n                    <div class=\"details-title\">Interview Details</div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-item\">\n                        <div class=\"detail-label\">Type</div>\n                        <div class=\"detail-value\">On-site</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-item\">\n                        <div class=\"detail-label\">Date</div>\n                        <div class=\"detail-value\">2026-07-29</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-item\">\n                        <div class=\"detail-label\">Time</div>\n                        <div class=\"detail-value\">10:40</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-item\">\n                        <div class=\"detail-label\">Location</div>\n                        <div class=\"detail-value\">George Steuart Optimize — BoardRoom</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <p style=\"margin-top: 25px; font-weight: bold;\">Please confirm your availability for this schedule by clicking one of the buttons below:</p>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 25px 0;\">\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost:3000/confirm-interview?id=31&response=yes\" class=\"confirm-btn yes\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #10b981; border-top: 12px solid #10b981; border-bottom: 12px solid #10b981; border-left: 24px solid #10b981; border-right: 24px solid #10b981; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; color: #ffffff !important; margin-right: 15px;\">Yes, I am available</a>\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost:3000/confirm-interview?id=31&response=no\" class=\"confirm-btn no\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #ef4444; border-top: 12px solid #ef4444; border-bottom: 12px solid #ef4444; border-left: 24px solid #ef4444; border-right: 24px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; color: #ffffff !important;\">No, I cannot attend</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <p>We look forward to discussing your potential contribution to George Steuart Group.</p>\n\n                <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">Best regards,<br>\n                <strong style=\"color: #1a1a2e;\">Talent Acquisition Team</strong><br>\n                George Steuart Group</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer\">\n                © 2026 George Steuart Group. All Rights Reserved.<br>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 10px; margin-top: 10px;\">This is an automated notification.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>', 'sent', '1', NULL, '2026-07-02 10:40:07', '2026-07-02 10:40:12'),
